<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded Kansas City Power and Light Co to market outperformer from trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Kansas City remain unchanged at 29-1/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
